# VISUALS — Propulsor Installation

This folder contains visual references for the propulsor installation procedure.

## Contents

Place the following visual assets here:
- Installation sequence diagrams
- Rigging arrangement photos
- Alignment reference photos
- Torque sequence diagrams
- Connection routing diagrams

## Naming Convention

```
Q100-61-INST-VIS-PROPULSOR-[DESCRIPTION]-[SEQ].svg
```

Examples:
- Q100-61-INST-VIS-PROPULSOR-LIFT-FIXTURE-001.svg
- Q100-61-INST-VIS-PROPULSOR-TORQUE-PATTERN-001.svg
- Q100-61-INST-VIS-PROPULSOR-ROUTING-001.svg

